   "primary": "Delayed-trigger abuse: on your own turn, let the 'at the beginning of the next end step' liability (lose the game, sacrifice, exile) go on the stack, then tap Obeka to end the turn and exile it. Risky extra turns become free extra turns, and temporary tokens, clones and reanimations become permanent.",
